    <!-- KATI-BEGIN(K-12 supports-rtl) mob_new=0.4.20
         Adds android:supportsRtl="true" to <application> below. Android's
         default is FALSE, so without it the root CompositionLocalProvider
         fights a window that never mirrors. Fenced here rather than around the
